<title>USA: Apple OS 8 system sales up sharply.</title>
<headline>Apple OS 8 system sales up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>CUPERTINO, Calif. 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apple Computer Inc Friday said more than 1.2 million copies of its Mac OS 8 operating system have been sold since the product's retail introduction on July 26, quadrupling the company's expectations.</p>
<p>Mac OS 8 is the latest operating system software release for the Macintosh and Mac OS compatible systems -- and the most significant upgrade since 1984.</p>
